y>が<ruby>人体<rp>(</rp><rt>じんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>有害<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であるという<ruby>事実<rp>(</rp><rt>じじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、すべての<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每个人都知道这种科学物质对人体有害的事实。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんぶつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人物；人；角色；人物形象；品格；性格；人品；能人；人才；有才能的人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230735\">あの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどんな<ruby>人物<rp>(</rp><rt>じんぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请告诉我他是谁?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人文科学</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんぶんかがく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人文科学；人文学科</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人民</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんみん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人民；民众；大众</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141420\"><ruby>専制君主<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせいくんしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人民<rp>(</rp><rt>じんみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>弾圧<rp>(</rp><rt>だんあつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">统治者压迫人民。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人命</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人命；生命</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人類</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じんるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人类；人类社会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143923\"><ruby>人類<rp>(</rp><rt>じんるい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけが<ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只有人类才知道如何使用火焰。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ジーパン</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">牛仔裤；工装裤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176590\"><ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にジーパンをくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的哥哥给了我日本。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ジーンズ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">牛仔裤；牛仔布；斜纹粗棉布</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154676\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>日曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>にちようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたいていジーンズをはいている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我星期天通常穿牛仔裤。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/850125\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">巣</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">す</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">巢；窝；繁殖地；蜂巢；巢穴；窝；常去之处；老巢；蜘蛛网；网</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"125805\"><ruby>鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>巣<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られるかもしれない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可以看到鸟儿的巣。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">酢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">す</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">醋</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143895\"><ruby>酢<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすっぱい<ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>あじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">玉米的味道充满了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">水泳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいえい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">游泳</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158056\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>み<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>午後<rp>(</rp><rt>ごご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>水泳<rp>(</rp><rt>すいえい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我在夏季假期中午游泳。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">水源</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">水源；河源；源头</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141377\"><ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まるところが、<ruby>水源<rp>(</rp><rt>すいげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">河流的起点是水源。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遂行</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいこう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">执行；完成</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">遂</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">水産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すいさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m